    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="1a1a0c83-2195-5256-a853-1974cf49c0a3" activityNameId="8a34fe0f-7b64-5ada-add1-03fadf18a988" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Penta-erythritol, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Penta-erythritol, at plant
The multioutput-process "reaction of formaldehyde with acetaldehyde" delivers the co-products "penta-erythritol, at plant" and "sodium formate from the reaction of formaldehyde with acetaldehyde".Sodium formate can be used as a fuel or sold. Assuming the formate is sold, the massxprice relation between penta and formate is 9.6:1, which is the figure entered into the inventory output.;
Formula: C5H12O4; 
UUID: 381d45d0-ef16-3f84-a292-8e7b5592199a
cradle-to-gate, including all precursors, ancillary materials and transports
Location: RER
Technology: based on literature data and plant data in Europe 
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature, survey 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_381d45d0-ef16-3f84-a292-8e7b5592199a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
